hss.evt(co,"A week later, after editing and submitting the footage, everyone heads to a nearby pub to celebrate!", "")
hss.evt(co,"{CONNECTED_CHARACTER_NAME} buys a round for the whole cast and crew and chats up the bartender while he pulls the drinks.", "")
